 <p align="left"><b><font size="3">Well hello there! :p</font><br>
 </b><font size="1" color="#736459">May 29. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Wow, it's been a month since last time! Someone is slacking
around here... But, at least I aint slacking in the game. Darksphere has been
busy, besides some of the usual farming and fighting people's urge to try out
new games and such, we have still managed to put down some major targets this
last month! Due to some technical problems and such, the pictures in this update
will be few, but there will be some quotes to make up for it! :p</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/210.jpg" width="257" height="14"></p>
<p align="left">Of new mobs that we have added to our kill list, you can add:</p>
<p align="left">Rhag'Zhezum<br>
Rhag'Mozdezh<br>
Telkorenar<br>
Thought Horror Overfiend<br>
Statue of Rallos Zek<br>
Idol of Rallos Zek<br>
A glyph covered serpent<br>
Arch Lich Rhag'Zadune<br>
Avatar of War<br>
and.. TERRIS THULE!</p>
<p align="left">That's right, another of the PoP epic mobs down to the hand of
Darksphere! She gave us one hell of a fight, but in the end, the outcome is
always the same. WE WIN! Grats Darksphere!</p>
<p align="left">Another epic mob of EQ went down to us finally. It aint easy at
all winning the race to this mob, but finally we did. With the death of Statue
and The Avatar of War, we can finally say that we have cleared Kael 100%! Grats
Vikos, finally, on your Blade of Carnage!</p>
<p align="left">As we said, we keep on hitting Ssra temple alot, this time our
victim was the Rhag's. We had it before, but it was bugged and R2 never spawned
for us /sigh. But this time there was no escape! A swift late night move and the
2 first Rhag's was down in no time. The Arch Lich ate just a few after, with no
complications at all. Grats Darksphere!<p align="left">A few pics for your
viewing pleasure.<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/RhagZhe.png" width="512" height="384"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/RhagMoz.png" width="512" height="384"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/AL.png" width="512" height="384"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Glyphed.png" width="512" height="384"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Idol.png" width="512" height="384"><p align="center">Grats
Vikos on your BoC!!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/VikosBoC.png" width="512" height="384"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/AoW.png" width="565" height="462"><p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/ALloot.png" width="116" height="286"><img border="0" src="Kills/Glyphedloot.png" align="top" width="116" height="224"><img border="0" src="Kills/RhagZheloot.png" align="top" width="116" height="283"><img border="0" src="Kills/RhagMozloot.png" align="top" width="116" height="237"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Statueloot.png" width="116" height="205"><p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="center">Grats
to all the winners! (Sorry for the missing loot shots, the SoE dev teams is in
charge of our tech department atm.)<p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="left">The
love in this guild...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/211.jpg" width="439" height="26"><p align="left">Popsickle?<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/212.jpg" width="435" height="27"><p align="left">This
one time, at band camp...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/213.jpg" width="435" height="39"><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/214.jpg" width="316" height="39"><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/215.jpg" width="433" height="26">


