 <p align="left">&nbsp;


 <p align="left"><b><font size="3">We're back!</font><br>
 </b><font size="1" color="#736459">April 29. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">That's right! We're back and kicking! Had a minor problem with
the old host of our page and had to move :P Remember to update your bookmarks!</p>
<p align="left">So what has Darkpshere been up to since you last paid us a visit
: A LOT. I could spend the next couple of hours entertaining you about it, but I
will spare you of that experience!</p>
<p align="left">We killed tons more Dain's, a few Tormax's, got a dozen more ST
keys completed our first Ring war and then our second :P Few more shawl wars, a
bit of BoT, maze events yada yada yada, the usual boring stuff that we all hate
but need. Yea I know nothing great, but then listen to this.</p>
<p align="left"><b>NToV CLEARED </b>on our first run on it ever. Flawless
clearing, 5 days there (thanks for the patch SoE) and a total of 1 wipe :P 1337!
Tons of lewt, many upgrades and we had one hell of time there!</p>
<p align="left">Xerkizh the Creator joins the rank of our new biatches. First
kill on him too, went down without any complications.</p>
<p align="left"><b>TUNARE</b> the High Ho in PoG took one too, also dropped on
the first try, flawless kill only a ranger died I think, perfect.</p>
<p align="left">Grieg Veneficus also took not one, but 3 dirt naps since last
time! So leet!</p>
<p align="left">A few pictures for your viewing pleasure!</p>
