<p align="left">As you can see, we have been busy! ;) More new target's incoming
for us, cause we're going all the way up there!</p>
<p align="left">A big thanks to the NToV crew, you did one hell of a job in
there!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/NToVcrew.jpg" width="614" height="461"></p>
